      "message": "[error] Line 371: 🔴 `media-\u003estop()` is called directly here (and similarly in `browserConferenceRemoved`, `cancelBrowserConference`, and the `hostBrowserConference` shutdown callback) instead of using `stopBrowserOwner()`. That loses the IO-thread handoff and exception containment already implemented in `stopBrowserOwner()`, so `stop()` can run on the wrong thread or throw through public API paths. Route all browser-media stop paths through a single helper (`stopBrowserOwner` + local try/catch/log) before hangup.",
