      "message": "[error] Line 454: 🔴 In the browser-conference failure callback, after `auto host \u003d registry-\u003etake(key, confId);` you emit failure and hang up, but never stop `host-\u003emedia`. Because the entry is already removed from the registry, the shutdown callback can no longer reclaim/stop it. Stop the media explicitly (via `stopBrowserOwner(host-\u003emedia)`) before `hangupConference` to avoid leaking or leaving media processing alive.",
